<title>USA: Luby's Cafeterias CEO John Curtis dies.</title>
<headline>Luby's Cafeterias CEO John Curtis dies.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luby's Cafeterias said Thursday its president and chief executive officer, John Curtis, had died.</p>
<p>Curtis, who joined the company in 1979, took on the position of chief executive in January.</p>
<p>A company official said the cause of death had yet to be revealed and a replacement had yet to be named.</p>
</text>
